# Keep build contexts small and make sure no local secrets or scratch state
# can be COPYed into an image (Dockerfile.web copies packages/web/ wholesale,
# and a Vite .env.local there would be inlined into the public bundle).
.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
.env*
!.env.example
db-backups
TRASH
TRASH-FILES.md
.superpowers
.agent-reports
.claude
.codex
docs
*.md
!packages/mcp/README.md
